    "detailed_description": "He's a dad AND a radish. Dadish's kids are missing and he needs your help to find them!<br><br>After his children are lured away by dubious pop-up advertising, Dadish sets out to find them in his most exciting adventure yet. Explore an exciting world, face off with fast-food themed foes, and reunite Dadish with his missing children in this challenging 3D platforming adventure.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A challenging 3D platformer<br></li><li>Dialogue that is sort of funny<br></li><li>Ride on the back of a giant hamburger (who is also a criminal)<br></li><li>50 cool levels to beat<br></li><li>49 sassy baby radishes and one screechy Possum to find<br></li><li>Fast-food dudes that will try to kill you<br></li><li>Five big grumpy bosses<br></li><li>Experience the highs and lows of being a parent (who is also a radish)<br></li><li>I enjoy the soundtrack and I hope you do too<br></li><li>The graphics are great, I think<br></li><li>Collectable stars hidden in every stage<br></li><li>Unlock exciting secrets<br></li><li>Believe in yourself and follow your heart</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "He's a dad AND a radish. Dadish's kids are missing and he needs your help to find them!<br><br>After his children are lured away by dubious pop-up advertising, Dadish sets out to find them in his most exciting adventure yet. Explore an exciting world, face off with fast-food themed foes, and reunite Dadish with his missing children in this challenging 3D platforming adventure.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A challenging 3D platformer<br></li><li>Dialogue that is sort of funny<br></li><li>Ride on the back of a giant hamburger (who is also a criminal)<br></li><li>50 cool levels to beat<br></li><li>49 sassy baby radishes and one screechy Possum to find<br></li><li>Fast-food dudes that will try to kill you<br></li><li>Five big grumpy bosses<br></li><li>Experience the highs and lows of being a parent (who is also a radish)<br></li><li>I enjoy the soundtrack and I hope you do too<br></li><li>The graphics are great, I think<br></li><li>Collectable stars hidden in every stage<br></li><li>Unlock exciting secrets<br></li><li>Believe in yourself and follow your heart</li></ul>",
